# QUY TAC VAN HANH TU DONG - NGUOI NONG DAN SO HOA (NGUYEN DUY ANH)
1. Thu muc nay ket noi truc tiep voi kho GitHub Pages: https://nguyenduyanh1323-dot.github.io/ (nhanh main).
2. Moi bai giang HTML moi phai dat ten khong dau noi gach duoi (VD: MMDD_Ten_Bai_Giang_V0X.html).
3. Khi co thay doi hoac duoc yeu cau xuat ban, tu dong kiem tra cu phap HTML, cap nhat lien ket len index.html va chay: git add . && git commit -m "Cap nhat tu dong" && git push origin main.
4. Tuyet doi dung tu "cong dong", khong nhac ten mien cu duyanhcma.com.
